{"seq":1,"slug":"products-that-changed-the-world","title":"改变世界的产品","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/core-contributions/products-that-changed-the-world","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-mac-and-personal-computing","title":"麦金塔与个人计算","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/core-contributions/products-that-changed-the-world/the-mac-and-personal-computing","wordCount":1837,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"ipod-iphone-and-ipad","title":"iPod、iPhone 与 iPad","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/core-contributions/products-that-changed-the-world/ipod-iphone-and-ipad","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"改变世界的产品\">改变世界的产品</h1><p>乔布斯最核心的贡献，是他缔造的一系列改变世界的产品。本章聚焦这些标志性产品的开创性意义，分析它们如何重新定义了各自的领域。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述麦金塔如何把图形用户界面与鼠标带入大众，让个人电脑变得人人可用。第二篇文档讲述 iPod、iPhone 与 iPad 如何分别重塑了音乐、手机与移动计算，开启了移动互联网时代。</p>\n"}